DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
14632::$$$message_0115_0000_0000$$$::"Did we get through everything?"[lr]::
14633::$$$message_0115_0000_0001$$$::"Hm, yeah."::
14634::$$$message_0115_0001_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=一成02b(中) textoff=0]Issei writes something in his notebook and nods.[lr]::
14635::$$$message_0115_0001_0001$$$::Preparing for the cultural festival[line len=3]even though it's a weekend, we came to Shinto to place orders for materials and go around greeting stores that would be cooperating with us.[lr]::
14636::$$$message_0115_0001_0002$$$::As for me[line len=3]I came as an advisor for food and material-related things that Issei's not knowledgeable about, but I didn't think that there would be this many stores participating.::
14637::$$$message_0115_0002_0000$$$::"This side of town is a new area. You can see it as our cultural festival being used for them to build a close relationship with the local town, but we're also being helped. If you think of it that way, it's not a bad thing."::
14638::$$$message_0115_0003_0000$$$::"But what happened to the shopping district that helped us from before?"[lr]::
14639::$$$message_0115_0003_0001$$$::"That's no problem. Our inquiries include plenty of things outside the category of the shopping district."[lr]::
14640::$$$message_0115_0003_0002$$$::"I see, so it's pretty complicated."::
14641::$$$message_0115_0004_0000$$$::[clfg textoff=0 time=300 pos=all]And so, even though I was brought with the title of advisor, I was worried about how much I could help out.[lr]::
14642::$$$message_0115_0004_0001$$$::We finish our task for now and as we're about to leave, we find an unexpected person in front of a menswear store.::
14643::$$$message_0115_0005_0000$$$::"Oh, it's Caster."[lr]::
14644::$$$message_0115_0005_0001$$$::"It seems like it."[lr]::
14645::$$$message_0115_0005_0002$$$::"Oh, hello boys."[lr]::
14646::$$$message_0115_0005_0003$$$::Issei makes a sour face for some reason. It seems like he gets in a bad mood whenever he sees Caster.::
14647::$$$message_0115_0006_0000$$$::"Hey boy, are you sure it's okay to leave behind your precious Saber and hang out with your guy friend in a place like this?"[lr]::
14648::$$$message_0115_0006_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
14649::$$$message_0115_0006_0002$$$::[font italic=true]...What kind of thing is she saying at first encounter?[font italic=false][lr]::
14650::$$$message_0115_0006_0003$$$::Caster is troubling to deal with, whether you're in a bad mood or a good mood.::
14651::$$$message_0115_0007_0000$$$::"...Is it okay for you to leave behind Mr. Kuzuki too, Caster?"[lr]::
14652::$$$message_0115_0007_0001$$$::I keep her in check unnecessarily like a busybody.[lr]::
14653::$$$message_0115_0007_0002$$$::"It's fine. I came to shop for Souichirou's things today anyway."[lr]::
14654::$$$message_0115_0007_0003$$$::Guh... My restraint has no effect at all.[lr]::
14655::$$$message_0115_0007_0004$$$::So, that's why she is in a good mood.::
14656::$$$message_0115_0008_0000$$$::"So you are shopping for Souichirou today."[lr]::
14657::$$$message_0115_0008_0001$$$::Issei clearly looks relieved.[lr]::
14658::$$$message_0115_0008_0002$$$::"Issei, are you that happy that Caster is shopping for Mr. Kuzuki?"[lr]::
14659::$$$message_0115_0008_0003$$$::"[line len=3]Mrgh, that's not it, but please don't ask."[lr]::
14660::$$$message_0115_0008_0004$$$::I nod.::
14661::$$$message_0115_0009_0000$$$::"Hey, Caster. Are you not buying any clothes today like the ones you bought last time?[lr]::
14662::$$$message_0115_0009_0001$$$::Do you have them at the temple even though you aren't wearing them?"[lr]::
14663::$$$message_0115_0009_0002$$$::"Wha[line len=2]you knew about that, Emiya!?"[lr]::
14664::$$$message_0115_0009_0003$$$::"Yeah. She was saying that she wanted Saber to wear them before."::
14665::$$$message_0115_0010_0000$$$::Some clothes that had a bunch of frills or something on them.[lr]::
14666::$$$message_0115_0010_0001$$$::At this point, Illya is in danger. I need to make sure she doesn't run into Caster.::
14667::$$$message_0115_0011_0000$$$::"[line len=3]Oh, no. [cacheimage storage=一成02b(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=一成02b(中) pos=r time=300 textoff=0]Well, it is Caster's taste, so I don't plan to interfere."[lr]::
14668::$$$message_0115_0011_0001$$$::"R-Really?"::
14669::$$$message_0115_0012_0000$$$::An awkward atmosphere flows between the two.[lr]::
14670::$$$message_0115_0012_0001$$$::Fuji-nee was like this when Rider started living at our place too... Are things not going well even though they live together?::
14671::$$$message_0115_0013_0000$$$::Come to think of it, did Caster and Mr. Kuzuki have a wedding?[lr]::
14672::$$$message_0115_0013_0001$$$::No, before that[line len=3]::
14673::$$$message_0115_0014_0000$$$::"...Hey, Caster. Did you formally get married to Mr. Kuzuki?"[lr]::
14674::$$$message_0115_0014_0001$$$::Oh, she's surprised.[lr]::
14675::$$$message_0115_0014_0002$$$::"...Boy. What is that supposed to mean?"[lr]::
14676::$$$message_0115_0014_0003$$$::"Wait, hold off on the murderous intent.[lr]::
14677::$$$message_0115_0014_0004$$$::...That wasn't sarcasm. I was wondering when you guys are going to as a supporter from the outside."::
14678::$$$message_0115_0015_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=キャスター私服01i(近)][say storage=cty0221_cas_0050 name=キャスター]I-I see.[lr]::
14679::$$$message_0115_0015_0001$$$::I-I didn't think that you were supporting us, boy. I-I'll thank you then."[lr]::
14680::$$$message_0115_0015_0002$$$::She's blushing. She's definitely blushing.::
14681::$$$message_0115_0016_0000$$$::"You can thank me after the happy ending.[lr]::
14682::$$$message_0115_0016_0001$$$::So, aren't you gonna have a wedding?"[lr]::
14683::$$$message_0115_0016_0002$$$::"I don't wish for that much. We just became a married couple on paper, and we haven't had a ceremony.[lr]::
14684::$$$message_0115_0016_0003$$$::...Although Reikan recommended us to."::
14685::$$$message_0115_0017_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14686::$$$message_0115_0017_0001$$$::Even though she seemed happy, that's what was causing her to seem a bit unhappy.[lr]::
14687::$$$message_0115_0017_0002$$$::From Caster's experience, she fears wishing for too great a happiness.[lr]::
14688::$$$message_0115_0017_0003$$$::...So. That means...::
14689::$$$message_0115_0018_0000$$$::"...On paper... Do you have a family register?"[lr]::
14690::$$$message_0115_0018_0001$$$::I ask her in a low voice. I bet it would be troublesome if Issei hears.::
14691::$$$message_0115_0019_0000$$$::"Do not worry. It hasn't become what you're worried about."[lr]::
14692::$$$message_0115_0019_0001$$$::"I'm glad... Did you brainwash the people at the government office?"::
14693::$$$message_0115_0020_0000$$$::"I didn't. It was something that could be solved with money.[lr]::
14694::$$$message_0115_0020_0001$$$::...If you're curious, you can ask the manager. About what happened when her bank balance suddenly increased."[lr]::
14695::$$$message_0115_0020_0002$$$::"[line len=3]Okay. I'll pretend like I didn't hear about this."::
14696::$$$message_0115_0021_0000$$$::"That's wise. I'm impressed with your ability to sense danger."[lr]::
14697::$$$message_0115_0021_0001$$$::Caster chuckles.[lr]::
14698::$$$message_0115_0021_0002$$$::...Mrgh. I feel like I'm starting to be able to talk normally with Caster lately... Even though we really don't get along...::
14699::$$$message_0115_0022_0000$$$::"...Emiya. I've been wondering. Do you and Caster know each other?"[lr]::
14700::$$$message_0115_0022_0001$$$::"Huh? Well, a lot happened."[lr]::
14701::$$$message_0115_0022_0002$$$::What happened isn't something that I can tell Issei.[lr]::
14702::$$$message_0115_0022_0003$$$::Caster must be thinking the same thing, as she silently signals at me.::
14703::$$$message_0115_0023_0000$$$::"Um, let's get going, Issei."[lr]::
14704::$$$message_0115_0023_0001$$$::"Mrgh... All right. I will see you later, Caster."[lr]::
14705::$$$message_0115_0023_0002$$$::"All right."[lr]::
14706::$$$message_0115_0023_0003$$$::We leave Caster at the storefront.[lr]::
14707::$$$message_0115_0023_0004$$$::Things sound rough at Ryudou Temple, too.::
14708::$$$message_0115_0024_0000$$$::"What's wrong, Emiya?"[lr]::
14709::$$$message_0115_0024_0001$$$::"No, it's nothing."[lr]::
14710::$$$message_0115_0024_0002$$$::Maybe I'll go and see how things are next time[line len=3]::
914675::$$$message_9115_0014_0002$$$::"...Boy. What is that supposed to mean?"[r]j�F�